## Third-party data

No third-party data is redistributed in this repository. Data sources retain their own
licences, recorded per dataset in `data/*/SOURCE.md` and catalogued in
[`docs/02-data-sources.md`](docs/02-data-sources.md). Users are responsible for complying
with those terms — note in particular that some sources (e.g. Renewables.ninja) are
non-commercial only.

## Disclaimer

Statements about German energy law and market rules in this repository are the author's
working understanding for research purposes and are **not legal advice**. Verify against the
current consolidated legal texts and the relevant regulatory decisions before relying on them.
